            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset contains processed experimental data and software supporting the manuscript “Unraveling Transport Mechanisms of Microparticles through Direct Imaging of Individual Particles.”\n\nThe repository includes:\n• processed breakthrough curve (BTC) data\n• source data for figures and tables\n• MATLAB scripts used for trajectory and BTC analysis\n• STANMOD model files used for transport simulations\n\nRaw microscopy images are provided as representative examples of the experimental observations. Due to the very large size of the complete raw imaging dataset, the full image archive is not included in this repository. The complete raw image archive is retained by the corresponding author and may be shared for specific research purposes if needed."
                }
              }
            ]
